      "message": "Exactly for that reason, also with this fix in we can still prefer a big CPU over a LITTLE one.\n\nIn this case, the main issue I think boils down to understand if we really want boosted tasks to prefer big CPUs... since this seems what we imply by visiting CPUs starting from from big ones. Otherwise, we should also change the start_cpu definition to consider just \"prefer_idle\" tasks.",
