      "writtenOn": "2018-03-06T12:37:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Changing this by:\n  cpu \u003d start_cpu(prefer_idle);\nshould have no impact as of today since all boosted tasks are prefer-idle (and vice versa). What should be done with non-prefer-idle boosted tasks (if we eventually have to deal with them) isn\u0027t clear so it\u0027s probably a good idea to manage them exactly like the non-boosted and non-prefer-idle tasks for now, for consistency.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 6760,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 6760,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "3a883fa8d589e3ba1af9991730a26c7c64bf0103",
